#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:4
msgid "Checkbox"
msgstr "Checkbox"

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:6
msgid ""
"Компонент **Checkbox** позволяет пользователю выбрать одно булево "
"значение (да/нет, true/false)."
msgstr ""
"The **Checkbox** component allows users to select a single boolean value "
"(yes/no, true/false)."

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:8
msgid ""
"`См. описание Checkbox на Form.io <https://help.form.io/userguide/forms"
"/form-components#check-box>`_"
msgstr ""
"`See Checkbox description on Form.io <https://help.form.io/userguide/forms"
"/form-components#check-box>`_"

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:10
msgid ":ref:`См. общее описание компонента Checkbox<Checkbox>`"
msgstr ":ref:`See general description of the Checkbox component<Checkbox>`"

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:17
msgid "Видимость компонента: customConditional и Logic"
msgstr "Component Visibility: customConditional and Logic"

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:19
msgid "Checkbox поддерживает два независимых механизма управления видимостью:"
msgstr "Checkbox supports two independent visibility control mechanisms:"

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:21
msgid ""
"**customConditional** — JavaScript-выражение на вкладке **Conditional**, "
"которое вычисляется при каждом изменении данных формы. Результат "
"(``true`` / ``false``) определяет, должен ли компонент отображаться."
msgstr ""
"**customConditional** — a JavaScript expression on the **Conditional** "
"tab that is evaluated on every form data change. The result "
"(``true`` / ``false``) determines whether the component should be "
"displayed."

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Logic** — правила на вкладке **Logic**, которые могут программно "
"устанавливать свойство ``component.hidden``."
msgstr ""
"**Logic** — rules on the **Logic** tab that can programmatically set the "
"``component.hidden`` property."

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:24
msgid "Оба механизма работают **независимо** и применяются совместно:"
msgstr "Both mechanisms work **independently** and are applied together:"

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:26
msgid ""
"компонент скрыт, если ``customConditional`` вернул ``false`` **или** "
"Logic установила ``hidden = true``."
msgstr ""
"the component is hidden if ``customConditional`` returned ``false`` "
"**or** Logic set ``hidden = true``."

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:27
msgid "если ни одно из условий не задано, компонент отображается."
msgstr "if neither condition is set, the component is displayed."

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:30
msgid "Пример customConditional"
msgstr "customConditional Example"

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:32
msgid "Скрыть Checkbox, пока поле ``status`` не равно ``\"active\"``:"
msgstr "Hide the Checkbox until the ``status`` field equals ``\"active\"``:"

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:39
msgid "Пример совместного использования"
msgstr "Combined Usage Example"

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:41
msgid "На форме есть Checkbox с:"
msgstr "The form has a Checkbox with:"

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:43
msgid "**customConditional**: ``show = data.role === 'manager';``"
msgstr "**customConditional**: ``show = data.role === 'manager';``"

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:44
msgid ""
"**Logic**: при событии ``change`` поля ``department`` устанавливает "
"``component.hidden = true``."
msgstr ""
"**Logic**: on the ``change`` event of the ``department`` field, sets "
"``component.hidden = true``."

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:46
msgid ""
"В этом случае Checkbox отображается только если **оба** условия разрешают"
" показ: компонент скрыт, когда ``data.role !== 'manager'`` **или** когда "
"Logic установила ``hidden = true``."
msgstr ""
"In this case, the Checkbox is displayed only if **both** conditions allow "
"display: the component is hidden when ``data.role !== 'manager'`` **or** "
"when Logic set ``hidden = true``."

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:51
msgid ""
"До версии, включающей исправление задачи **#96**, ``customConditional`` "
"игнорировался при наличии Logic-правил. Убедитесь, что используете "
"актуальную версию ecos-ui, если формы с обоими механизмами работали "
"некорректно."
msgstr ""
"Prior to the version that includes the fix for task **#96**, "
"``customConditional`` was ignored when Logic rules were present. Make "
"sure you are using an up-to-date version of ecos-ui if forms with both "
"mechanisms were working incorrectly."

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:55
msgid "Особенности реализации (для разработчиков)"
msgstr "Implementation Details (for Developers)"

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:57
msgid ""
"Checkbox в Citeck переопределяет метод ``updateVisible`` базового класса "
"formiojs. Это необходимо для корректной работы в контейнере **Columns** с"
" включённым ``autoAdjust`` (элемент скрывается через ``visibility: "
"hidden`` вместо атрибута ``hidden``, чтобы ячейка колонки не сжималась)."
msgstr ""
"Checkbox in Citeck overrides the ``updateVisible`` method of the formiojs"
" base class. This is necessary for correct operation inside the "
"**Columns** container with ``autoAdjust`` enabled (the element is hidden "
"via ``visibility: hidden`` instead of the ``hidden`` attribute, so the "
"column cell does not collapse)."

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:62
msgid "Видимость вычисляется как:"
msgstr "Visibility is computed as:"

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:68
msgid "где:"
msgstr "where:"

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:70
msgid ""
"``component.hidden`` — устанавливается Logic-правилами (Pipeline 2 в "
"formiojs)."
msgstr ""
"``component.hidden`` — set by Logic rules (Pipeline 2 in formiojs)."

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:71
msgid ""
"``_visible`` — устанавливается ``customConditional`` / стандартной "
"логикой ``conditional`` (Pipeline 1 в formiojs)."
msgstr ""
"``_visible`` — set by ``customConditional`` / standard ``conditional`` "
"logic (Pipeline 1 in formiojs)."

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/checkbox.rst:73
msgid ""
"Строгая проверка ``=== false`` для ``_visible`` важна: она предотвращает "
"ложное скрытие компонента, пока formiojs ещё не инициализировал это поле "
"(значение ``undefined`` трактуется как «видим»)."
msgstr ""
"The strict ``=== false`` check for ``_visible`` is important: it prevents"
" the component from being falsely hidden while formiojs has not yet "
"initialized this field (a value of ``undefined`` is treated as "
"\"visible\")."

